config.menu.name.ExtremeForgingAdditions=Extreme Forging Additions
config.menu.comment.ExtremeForgingAdditions=Set how many modifiers equipment may gain and the draw weight of each modifier.

config.tab.modifier_gain_count=Gain Count Weights
config.tab.modifier_gain_count.comment=Each level-up draws 1, 2, 3, or 4 modifier gains by weight. A higher weight makes that count more likely.
config.tab.tool_modifier_weights=Tool Modifier Weights
config.tab.tool_modifier_weights.comment=Set the draw weight of each tool modifier. Higher weights are more likely, and 0 prevents random gains.
config.tab.armor_modifier_weights=Armor Modifier Weights
config.tab.armor_modifier_weights.comment=Set the draw weight of each armor modifier. Higher weights are more likely, and 0 prevents random gains.

config.name.extreme-forging-additions.modifierRollCountOneWeight=Weight for 1 gain
config.comment.extreme-forging-additions.modifierRollCountOneWeight=Higher weights make equipment more likely to gain 1 modifier on level-up. Default 1.
config.name.extreme-forging-additions.modifierRollCountTwoWeight=Weight for 2 gains
config.comment.extreme-forging-additions.modifierRollCountTwoWeight=Higher weights make equipment more likely to gain 2 modifiers on level-up. Default 0, so it will not happen unless changed.
